X;**********************************************
X;*
X;*	read or write a pixel:
X;*		DX = row # ( y )
X;*		CX = col # ( x )
X;*		AH = 12 for write, 13 for read
X;*		AL = value (0,1, if bit 7=1 EXOR the value)
